HOW TO INSTALL

1.  copy whole contents of this project in your machine
    ex.) git clone https://github.com/linguaomnis/forkexec.git /opt/forkexec;
    or simply via zip

2.  do "make" for this project
    ex.) make -C /opt/forkexec/src;

3.  do "make install" for this project
    ex.) make install -C /opt/forkexec/src;

4.  add path /opt/forkexec/bin to $PATH
    in ${HOME}.bashrc,
    ex.) open ${HOME}.bashrc to edit it

        from:
        > # User specific environment
        > if ! [[ "$PATH" =~ "$HOME/.local/bin:$HOME/bin:" ]]; then
        >     PATH="$HOME/.local/bin:$HOME/bin:$PATH"
        > fi
        > export PATH

        to:
        > # User specific environment
        > export FORKEXEC="/opt/forkexec";
        > if ! [[ "$PATH" =~ "$FORKEXEC/bin:$HOME/.local/bin:$HOME/bin:" ]]; then
        >     PATH="$FORKEXEC/bin:$HOME/.local/bin:$HOME/bin:$PATH"
        > fi
        > export PATH

5.  /etc/ld.so.conf.d/forkexec.conf like that
    ex.)
        > # echo '/opt/forkexec/lib' > /etc/ld.so.conf.d/forkexec.conf

HOW TO UNINSTALL

1.  do "make uninstall" for this project
    ex.) make uninstall -C /opt/forkexec/src;

